cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AllPrime in your work, please cite it as below. / Çalışmanızda AllPrime'ı kullandıysanız lütfen aşağıdaki gibi atıf yapın."
type: software
title: "AllPrime: a desktop program for variant-specific PCR primer design"
abstract: "AllPrime is a Windows desktop program that designs PCR primers for genomic variants, cDNA (c. notation), pasted sequences and deletion / duplication breakpoints, checks primer-pair specificity against a local human genome and avoids common variants (dbSNP). Calculations use primer3."
authors:
  - family-names: "Kılınç"
    given-names: "Eren"
    email: "eren.501kilinc@gmail.com"
version: "1.1.4"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24444832"
license: "GPL-2.0-or-later"
url: "https://allprime-app.github.io/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/allprime-app/AllPrime"
keywords:
  - primer design
  - PCR
  - variant
  - primer3
  - specificity
  - bioinformatics
